This component vendors source code from MorseMicro/morse_driver
(https://github.com/MorseMicro/morse_driver) which is licensed under
GPL-2.0-or-later. Vendored files retain their original SPDX-License-
Identifier headers.

The Warthog-authored shim and glue code (src/shim/, src/mesh/mesh_compat*.c,
include/halow_mesh.h) is also released under GPL-2.0-or-later to maintain
license consistency with the vendored Linux kernel sources.

When this component is linked into the Warthog firmware (via the
WARTHOG_MESH_COMPAT Kconfig option), the resulting binary is licensed
GPL-2.0-or-later as a whole. The default Warthog build (mesh disabled)
remains under the project's primary license without GPL propagation.

For the full GPL-2.0-or-later license text, see:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html
